Scope of this license

The MIT License above applies to the source code in this repository
(app/, src/, tests/, tools and configuration files) and to the documentation
written for this project.

It does NOT apply to the files derived from the CS2CD dataset:

  data/pairs.csv, data/pairs_new.csv
  data/reference/v1/
  models/v1/
  samples/analysis/

Those files are shared under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license (CC-BY-4.0), with attribution to the CS2CD dataset
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/CS2CD/CS2CD.Counter-Strike_2_Cheat_Detection,
doi:10.57967/hf/5654). See DATA_ATTRIBUTION.md for the per-file assessment,
the attribution text and the description of changes.

Counter-Strike 2 map geometry and radar images are Valve property; they are
NOT included and are generated locally from the user's own game installation.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Valve Corporation.
